  "corrections": [
    {
      "what": "the repair task's owner",
      "was": "docs/UNIT_HIT_PATH.md described the repair task only as '0093CA20's this', with no location",
      "is": "the task is embedded in the unit instance at unit+A20h",
      "evidence": "008160dc ADD ECX,0xA20 before the call at 008160e5; 008ad699 LEA ECX,[ESI+0xA20] before 00939fe0; and 008ada11 FSTP [ESI+0xA48], the slot the hull step reads as task+28h"
    },
    {
      "what": "the task's +34h and +38h floats",
      "was": "docs/UNIT_HIT_PATH.md: 'fire and leak amounts the completion test requires to be zero'",
      "is": "countdown timers in seconds, decremented by dt and driving per-second damage through the unit's vtable[1ACh] AddDamage; the per-second rates are the separate floats at +2Ch and +30h",
      "evidence": "0093c120 and 0093c210 bodies: timer -= dt, clamp at 0, then AddDamage(elapsed * rate / divisor)"
    },
    {
      "what": "the task's +24h",
      "was": "docs/UNIT_HIT_PATH.md: 'task kind'",
      "is": "the repair priority the Lua binding SetRepairPriority (008ad6f0) sets, 0..4; each value boosts one of the five steps",
      "evidence": "0: hull (settings+3D4h), 1: failures (+3D0h), 2: subobjects (+3D8h), 3: water divisor (+3CCh), 4: fire divisor (+3C8h)"
    }
  ],
  "open_questions": [
    "The session message 9Eh, 9Fh and A0h handlers: the only writers of the fire and water rates and timers, of the hull-repair enable byte and of the priority.",
    "The repair task's constructor and therefore its initial state.",
    "Whether any native path other than script starts a fire or a leak; the only proven writers of the timers are the decrement steps.",
    "Which of +34h/+38h is fire is provisional, resting on the completion literal's word order, the test order in 0093ca20 and the 0/1 selector of SetFireDamage/SetWaterDamage.",
    "The repair priority enum's names; the crew-level category names from 0081ad40 are a different enum.",
    "vtable[1B8h] (max repair) and vtable[19Ch] (the named-state dispatch).",
    "The game-settings defaults at +3B4h, +3B8h, +3C8h..+3E0h, +3E8h and +46Ch."
  ]
